    "prior_disposition": "WITHHOLD",
    "prior_exact_reason": "The EXACT_MATCH source-grade guard does not catch this row. Its approved historical report assumes Nutrient Broth No. 2 and BD 234000 are catalog aliases of one nutrient-broth subject, but primary recipes distinguish them: NBRC 1559/Oxoid CM0067B uses Lab-Lemco 10 g/L, peptone 10 g/L and NaCl 5 g/L; ATCC Medium 3 identifies BD 234000 at 8 g/L, equivalent to beef extract 3 g/L and peptone 5 g/L, with no added NaCl. The manufacturer also explicitly distinguishes No. 2 from standard Oxoid nutrient broth. Preserve the source labels but withhold their equivalence until the product identities and generic superclass mapping are separated.",
